      "text": "BY DESIGN PHILOSOPHY:\n- Algebraic: Hamming, BCH, Reed-Solomon, Golay; exact math\n- Probabilistic: Turbo, LDPC, Polar; random-like graphs and iterative decode"
    },
    {
