        "title": "Channel Coding - Capacity and Error-Correcting Codes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "IMPLICATIONS:\n  • Can communicate reliably at ANY rate below capacity — but not above\n  • The theorem is EXISTENCE — doesn't say HOW to construct the code\n  • 70 years of coding theory = constructing codes that approach C efficiently"
    },
